I still want to believe in unchanging love and hope.

286
00:31:37,348 --> 00:31:43,848
キラリと流れてる 見つけて欲しいから、ここにいるの
Streaming with a flash—since I want you to find me, I'm right here.

287
00:31:43,848 --> 00:31:52,248
誰かが手を伸ばす合図で そっとまわる星青く 光って
At the signal of someone stretching out their hand, the slowly spinning heavenly body shines in blue.

288
00:31:52,348 --> 00:31:59,948
初めての冬がきたよ 誰もいない公園で 星がぶつかる音に胸が鳴る
The first winter has come to the empty park, my heart pounds with the sound of stars colliding.

289
00:31:59,948 --> 00:32:08,548
ブランコから見上げた空 名前はわからないけれど 近づきたいよほうき星になって
The sky I looked up at from the swing—though I don't know its name, I want to get close, becoming a comet.

290
00:32:39,148 --> 00:32:46,848
初めての冬がきたよ 誰もいない公園で
The first winter has come to the empty park,

291
00:32:46,848 --> 00:32:54,248
星がぶつかる音に胸が鳴る
my heart pounds with the sound of stars colliding.

292
00:32:54,248 --> 00:33:01,848
ブランコから見上げた空 名前はわからないけれど
The sky I looked up at from the swing—though I don't know its name,

293
00:33:01,848 --> 00:33:09,148
近づきたいよほうき星になって
I want to get close, becoming a comet.

294
00:33:09,148 --> 00:33:16,848
キラリと走る光 みんなが指さして笑っていた
The light running with a flash—everyone was pointing and smiling.

295
00:33:16,848 --> 00:33:24,348
君が私を呼んでるのだろう？ もっとつなぐ力にして 届いて
Are you calling for me? Put more power into connecting, and reach me!

296
00:33:24,348 --> 00:33:31,948
わた雲が消えていくのか 風が運んでいた
The fleecy clouds are vanishing—the wind was carrying them.

297
00:33:31,948 --> 00:33:39,848
夜の闇に私の姿映る
My form reflects in the dark of the night.

298
00:33:39,848 --> 00:33:47,348
最近は街あかりで 星を忘れてしまう人
People who flat out forget about the stars because of street lights these days,

299
00:33:47,348 --> 00:33:55,248
これがもう最後だから 見ていてね
since this is now the end, be watching, okay?

300
00:33:55,248 --> 00:34:02,848
キラリと流れてる 見つけて欲しいから、ここにいるの
Streaming with a flash—since I want you to find me, I'm right here.

301
00:34:02,848 --> 00:34:10,848
誰かが手を伸ばす合図で そっとまわる星青く 光って
