302
00:34:10,848 --> 00:34:18,948
キラリと走る星は 思い出すのさ、遊んでいたあの空
I remember the heavenly body that runs with a flash, that sky where we were playing.

303
00:34:18,948 --> 00:34:26,548
はじけて消えていく光の軌跡 また会おうね、この空で きっと
The tracks of the light that's popping and vanishing—we'll meet again, okay, in this sky, surely.

304
00:35:00,306 --> 00:35:03,756
キラリと流れてる 見つけたいから ここにいるの
A shooting star drifting across the sky, wanting to be found here.

305
00:35:04,106 --> 00:35:09,556
誰かが手を伸ばす合図で そっとまわる星 青く光って
As someone reaches out their hand, the stars spin softly, glowing blue.

306
00:35:10,556 --> 00:35:13,656
光って
Shining brightly...

307
00:35:42,556 --> 00:35:49,856
キナリと走る星は 思い出して遊んでいたあの空
Like a shooting star running across the sky, reminding me of the skies we played in.

308
00:35:50,056 --> 00:35:55,056
はじけて消えていく光の軌跡
The trail of light bursting and fading away.

309
00:35:55,556 --> 00:36:00,056
また会おうね、この空で
Let's meet again in this sky.

310
00:36:00,556 --> 00:36:02,056
きっと
For sure...

311
00:36:43,256 --> 00:36:47,856
きっと...
...For sure.

312
00:37:04,056 --> 00:37:08,556
鬼灯日和
[Song: Hozuki Biyori]

313
00:37:16,256 --> 00:37:19,056
沈む茜日
The setting crimson sun,

314
00:37:19,056 --> 00:37:22,556
染まる坂道
dyeing the slopes,

315
00:37:22,556 --> 00:37:25,556
歌う雫に
to the singing droplets,

316
00:37:25,556 --> 00:37:28,556
懐かしさにじむ
oozing with nostalgia.

317
00:37:29,056 --> 00:37:35,056
夜の帳の 近づく音に
As night's curtain draws near,

318
00:37:35,556 --> 00:37:41,856
はしゃいだ君の声一つ空に響いた
your excited voice echoed alone into the sky.

319
00:37:42,056 --> 00:37:48,556
稲荷の前で待ち合わせ 吊られた鳥居潜り抜け
Meeting in front of Inari shrine, slipping past hanging torii gates,

320
00:37:49,056 --> 00:37:51,556
小さな淡い影
a small, faint shadow

321
00:37:52,056 --> 00:37:55,056
胸をすり抜けてく
slipping through my chest.

322
00:37:55,556 --> 00:38:00,056
踊れ踊れ 手を組んで
Dance, dance, joining hands,

323
00:38:00,056 --> 00:38:04,556
夜更かしした僕らは
we who stayed up late,

324
00:38:04,556 --> 00:38:09,556
身動きも忘れて
forgetting how to move,

325
00:38:09,556 --> 00:38:13,556
燈すのは灯り、ひらひら
lighting up lights, fluttering,

326
00:38:13,556 --> 00:38:19,556
踊れ踊れ 手を組んで
Dance, dance, joining hands,

327
00:38:19,556 --> 00:38:23,056
妖気したほうへと
toward the eerie vibe,

328
00:38:23,056 --> 00:38:26,556
鳴り響く大鼓の音に
to the resounding taiko beat,

329
00:38:26,556 --> 00:38:30,056
赤い火がジグザグと
red flames zig-zagging,

330
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:32,556
君に気づけたかな
did I notice you?

331
00:38:39,556 --> 00:38:42,556
響くざわめき
Resounding commotion,

332
00:38:42,556 --> 00:38:45,556
燃ゆるかがり火
burning bonfires,

333
00:38:46,056 --> 00:38:49,056
揺らぐ気持ちに
swaying feelings,

334
00:38:49,056 --> 00:38:52,056
思い出せよう
let's recall.

335
00:38:52,056 --> 00:38:58,556
祭りばやしが 届く音に
To the sound of festival music reaching us,

336
00:38:59,056 --> 00:39:05,056
天の川の雲が暮れ胸を突いた
Milky Way clouds grew dark and pierced my chest.

337
00:39:05,056 --> 00:39:11,056
今宵空にはおぼろ月 かすんだ心ごまかした
Tonight's hazy moon disguised my clouded heart.

338
00:39:11,056 --> 00:39:15,056
下駄の音がカチカチ鳴って
The sound of geta clacking away,

339
00:39:15,056 --> 00:39:17,556
胸をすり抜けたら
slipping through my chest,

340
00:39:19,556 --> 00:39:24,056
目を閉じて巡れ巡れ意識をとざい
Closing eyes, spinning, shutting off consciousness,

341
00:39:24,056 --> 00:39:29,556
人よ人に募る嘘を月明かり照らす花火
fireworks illuminating lies between people under moonlight.

342
00:39:29,556 --> 00:39:36,556
自らはらはら泣いて泣いて流るる雫 嫁入り前のさよしぐれ
Crying, streaming droplets, a fleeting shower before a bride's departure.

343
00:39:36,556 --> 00:39:41,056
傘の外 聞くねびよりに
Outside the umbrella, hearing the sleeping weather,

344
00:39:41,056 --> 00:39:49,056
宵のしぐれ隠した 君に気づけたような気がした
hiding the evening shower, it felt like I noticed you.

345
00:40:17,496 --> 00:40:23,036
沈む茜染まる坂道
The sloping road dyed in setting sun's madder red...

346
00:40:23,576 --> 00:40:29,196
伝う霙に切なさ滲む
Sadness bleeds into the flowing sleet.

347
00:40:29,896 --> 00:40:35,866
夜の帳の近付く音に
To the sound of night's curtain approaching,

348
00:40:36,626 --> 00:40:42,936
はしゃいだキミの声ひとつ 空に響いていた
your excited voice echoed alone in the sky.

349
00:40:43,406 --> 00:40:49,136
稲荷の前で待ち合わせ
Meeting up in front of the Inari shrine,

350
00:40:50,246 --> 00:40:54,016
連なる鳥居くぐり抜け
passing through the rows of torii gates,

351
00:40:54,246 --> 00:40:59,966
鬼灯の甘い風 胸をすり抜けていった
the sweet breeze of Chinese lantern plants slipped through our chests.

352
00:41:00,336 --> 00:41:04,246
「踊ろうよ」
“Let's dance,”

353
00:41:04,366 --> 00:41:09,176
廻れ廻れ手を叩いてほら 見様見真似で輪になって
spin, spin, clap your hands, imitating each other to form a circle,

354
00:41:09,366 --> 00:41:14,446
ぎこちない振り付けに舞う 袖はひらひら
dancing with clumsy choreography, sleeves fluttering.

355
00:41:15,236 --> 00:41:19,526
踊れ踊れ手を取り合って 上気した頬牡丹色
Dance, dance, holding hands, flushed cheeks peony-colored,

356
00:41:19,876 --> 00:41:25,326
鳴り響く太鼓の音に 赤い果実弾けた
to the resonating sound of drums, red fruits burst open.

357
00:41:26,236 --> 00:41:31,086
キミに気付かれたかな？
Did you notice me, I wonder?

358
00:41:31,486 --> 00:41:36,486
響くざわめき燃ゆる狐火
Resonating commotion, burning foxfire.

359
00:42:00,739 --> 00:42:04,679
まだこの世界は 僕を飼い馴らしていたいみたいだ
It seems like this world still wants to keep on taming me,

360
00:42:05,059 --> 00:42:08,629
望み通りいいだろう 美しくもがくよ
just as it wishes, right? I'll beautifully struggle against it.

361
00:42:08,989 --> 00:42:13,749
互いの砂時計 眺めながらキスをしようよ
Let's kiss while gazing at each other's hourglasses.

362
00:42:14,139 --> 00:42:19,359
「さよなら」から一番 遠い 場所で待ち合わせしよう
Let's meet up in the place farthest from "goodbye."

363
00:42:20,079 --> 00:42:24,539
辞書にある言葉で 出来上がった世界を憎んだ
I hated the world built up with words in a dictionary.

364
00:42:24,779 --> 00:42:27,829
万華鏡の中で 八月のある朝
Inside a kaleidoscope, on a certain morning in August,

365
00:42:28,089 --> 00:42:31,669
君は僕の前で 恥ずかしそうに澄ましみせた
you acted all bashful and composed in front of me.

366
00:42:31,909 --> 00:42:36,259
この世界の教科書のような笑顔で
With a smile like the textbook of this world.

367
