ついに時はきた 昨日までは序章の序章で
The time has finally come—until yesterday was the prologue to the prologue.

368
00:42:41,589 --> 00:42:46,429
飛ばし読みでいいから ここからが僕だよ
You can skim it, but my main chapter starts right here.

369
00:42:46,789 --> 00:42:51,749
経験と知識と カビの生えかかった勇気を持って
Armed with experience, knowledge, and courage growing a bit of mold,

370
00:42:52,049 --> 00:42:56,619
いまだかつてない スピードで君のもとへダイブを
I'll dive to your side at a speed never seen before.

371
00:42:57,359 --> 00:43:02,229
まどろみの中で 生生しいコーラに
Over lukewarm cola in a drowsy haze,

372
00:43:02,329 --> 00:43:06,079
夢見たよ
I dreamed a dream.

373
00:43:06,379 --> 00:43:10,089
教室の窓の外に 電車に揺られ運ばれる朝に
Outside the classroom window, on a morning carried along, rocked by a train,

374
00:43:10,439 --> 00:43:14,419
愛し方さえも 君の匂いがした
even the way to love smelled like you.

375
00:43:14,659 --> 00:43:18,979
歩き方さえも その笑い声がした
Even the way of walking carried the sound of your laughter.

376
00:43:19,229 --> 00:43:25,629
いつか消えてなくなる君のすべてを この目に焼き付けておくことは もう権利なんかじゃない 義務だと思うんだ
Burning every part of you that will eventually vanish into my eyes—I believe that is no longer a right, but my duty.

377
00:43:26,219 --> 00:43:31,359
運命だとか未来とかって 言葉がどれだけ手を伸ばそうと届かない 場所で僕ら恋をする
No matter how far words like "fate" or "future" reach out, we fall in love in a place they cannot touch.

